+// gewu: coherent thin film. Reflectance of air / film (N1 = n1 + i k1, thickness d) / substrate
+// (N2 = n2 + i k2), unpolarised, at one wavelength (Airy's formula; tools/tmm.py is the reference).
+// The forward wave decays in every medium: Im(N cos) >= 0.
+PBRT_CPU_GPU inline Float ThinFilmR(Float cosTheta_i, Float lambda, Float d,
+                                    pstd::complex<Float> N1, pstd::complex<Float> N2) {
+    using Complex = pstd::complex<Float>;
+    Float c0 = Clamp(cosTheta_i, 0, 1);
+    Float sin2 = 1 - c0 * c0;
+    auto cosIn = [&](Complex N) {
+        Complex c = pstd::sqrt(Complex(1) - sin2 / (N * N));
+        Complex q = N * c;
+        if (q.im < 0 || (q.im == 0 && q.re < 0))
+            c = -c;
+        return c;
+    };
+    Complex c1 = cosIn(N1), c2 = cosIn(N2);
+    // phase factor exp(2 i beta), beta = 2 pi N1 cos1 d / lambda
+    Complex beta = (2 * Pi * d / lambda) * (N1 * c1);
+    Float amp = std::exp(-2 * beta.im);
+    Complex e(amp * std::cos(2 * beta.re), amp * std::sin(2 * beta.re));
+    Float R = 0;
+    for (int pol = 0; pol < 2; ++pol) {
+        // tilted admittances: N cos (s), N / cos (p)
+        Complex y0 = pol == 0 ? Complex(c0) : Complex(1 / c0);
+        Complex y1 = pol == 0 ? N1 * c1 : N1 / c1;
+        Complex y2 = pol == 0 ? N2 * c2 : N2 / c2;
+        Complex r01 = (y0 - y1) / (y0 + y1), r12 = (y1 - y2) / (y1 + y2);
+        Complex r = (r01 + r12 * e) / (Complex(1) + r01 * r12 * e);
+        R += pstd::norm(r);
+    }
+    return R / 2;
+}
+
+PBRT_CPU_GPU inline SampledSpectrum ThinFilmR(Float cosTheta_i, const SampledSpectrum &lambda,
